      "brand": "`primary` is the QuadX brand red — a DEEP BURGUNDY (#9E1B2E light / #B5273A dark) after the M14 theme review. It is kept as a recognizable accent, not the dominant UI colour, and stays DISTINCT from `destructive` (danger, a brighter crimson #D4183D). Strong red is reserved for errors/destructive/critical; a calmer TEAL secondary accent (`accent-brand`) carries standard actions, links, and selected states.",
      "provisional": "The exact burgundy and teal values are PROVISIONAL pending Brand/Design visual sign-off (open question A6). They are scalar hexes here and reversible in one place.",
      "hierarchy": "M14 visual hierarchy: burgundy = brand/primary; teal `accent-brand` = links/selected/informational; neutral grays = surfaces/nav/tables/ordinary controls; crimson `destructive` = errors/destructive only. Delivery/payment/ticket/SLA statuses spread across success/warning/info/destructive so they never all rely on red."
    }
  },

